{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-15_beg","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":252,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_main_16-15_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-15","storyName":"旷野轰鸣","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"第四集团军派来使者，希望女大公能在他们前去剿灭“叛乱”时保持沉默。博士等人为向同伴传递消息，使用了研究所中的应急通讯设备。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_16-15_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_16-14","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":15,"next":17,"characters":["叶莉莎女大公","严肃的乌萨斯军官","Mon3tr","科谢尼娅","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_bg_66_g2_farnorthgovernment.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodcracle","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":7},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"说来奇怪......","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"其实我很喜欢布列斯克的这个季节。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"没有太阳的东升西落，没有昼夜分明......人们也不用假装一切都很明了。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"“多事之秋”，元帅他也是这么说的。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"女大公殿下，时间紧迫。即使是在我享用您招待的这一杯热茶的时间里，局势也在不断变得紧张。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"元帅在等待您的答复。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"连叶甫根尼元帅都坐不住了，看来乌萨斯真的面临着巨大的麻烦。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"您完全正确。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"在这样的局势下，圣骏堡温吞的反应将不被接受——这不只是元帅一人的意见。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"时至今日，他应该早已理解，他的父亲在当年那场动乱中的举措堪称睿智——第四集团军本会有比发配边疆更坏的结局。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"那么如今，年轻的叶甫根尼，是下定决心要冲在眼下乱局的第一线了？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"永远站在离危险最近的地方保护乌萨斯——元帅在履行乌萨斯军人的天职。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"现在的问题，在于您，女大公殿下。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"元帅需要您还愿意维系往日的合作。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#2$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"这是他对我的通知？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"这是一个基于友谊的请求。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"元帅他非常重视与您的友谊，同样也信任您的智慧。他相信，即使在这个时候，布列斯克与第四集团军的利益也是紧密相连的。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"何况他并不请求您做什么额外的事——只要您的一个点头。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"听起来，他似乎认为这很容易。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#4$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"难道他将我们的皇帝陛下看作一个蠢材吗？难道维特议长也是一个蠢材吗？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"这是非此即彼的选择......就像太阳不会与黑夜共存。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"元帅非常理解您的处境，他当然愿意为您分忧。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"无论如何，一位“皇帝的利刃”的陨落，有非常充分的解释空间，而元帅愿意替您做出这个解释。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"“第四集团军协助布列斯克剿灭了发生在远北地区的叛乱”——只要您愿意合作，集团军呈交给圣骏堡的报告上，就只会有这样一句话。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"甚至不必点头，您的沉默，元帅也可以接受。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#4$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"不......并非如此......如果元帅他真的理解我，就该知道我在意的从来不是来自圣骏堡的质疑......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"生活在我的领地内的人民，乌萨斯的人民......我在意的只有他们。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"元帅理解您的仁慈，他向您保证，您划下的线，没有人可以逾越。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#2$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"年轻的叶甫根尼，急躁的叶甫根尼......我又怎会愿意看到我亲爱的朋友以身涉险。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"哪怕真的如他所愿，我保持沉默，这也不过是在他前行的崎路上抹去了一堆小小石子，那些巨大的山石他又准备如何处置？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"这些，就不劳女大公殿下烦忧了。无论是山石还是别的什么，元帅他有决心为乌萨斯战胜一切敌人。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"那么......我是否可以理解为，已经得到了您的答复。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#1$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"......","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"叶甫根尼元帅向您问好。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","text":"为了乌萨斯的荣光。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":65},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1962_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叶莉莎女大公","text":"一切为了乌萨斯的荣光......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1962_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":71},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_bg_66_g3_miningarea.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"0.5","channel":"1","delay":"0.4","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":82,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"科谢尼娅，你还好吗？需要的话我也可以抱着你们两人一起跑的！","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"不，不用。我......还好......","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我只是不明白......我们为什么......要这么急着赶路？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":90},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"92","text":"我有一个猜想......"}},"values":[],"id":91},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":92},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"94","text":"如果乌萨斯官方已经得知了矿脉的异变......"},"2":{"id":"94","text":"能让远北所有的矿区都陷入沉寂，只有一种解释——"}},"values":[],"id":93},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":94},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"96","text":"乌萨斯不会让矿脉枯竭的消息传播出去。"}},"values":[],"id":95},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":96,"end":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"......","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，你看天空的颜色！","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我们进来的时候，是这样的吗？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"......不......这是我的幻觉吗？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#7$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"为什么又是......这样的颜色？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-7$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_66_g4_miningarea_polluted.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"醒目的、带着警示意味的红色。你甚至不需要特意抬头就能看到的颜色。","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"它逐渐笼罩了原本是灰色的昏暗天幕，也笼罩了身处地面的一切。","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"115","text":"......军队。"},"2":{"id":"115","text":"乌萨斯军队的警示灯。"}},"values":[],"id":114},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":115},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"117","text":"他们已经来了。"}},"values":[],"id":116},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":117,"end":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#4$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"为什么......","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"为什么军队会在这个时候深入远北？他们根本不应该来到这里！","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，西北方五公里处检测到大规模的高能源石反应，有人在快速向我们靠近。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":124},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"126","text":"......马上回研究所。"},"2":{"id":"126","text":"必须立刻告知阿米娅。"}},"values":[],"id":125},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":126,"end":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"科谢尼娅，你还好吗？我们该加速了！","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"对，研究所......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我们要回研究所。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"charslot","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","delay":"0.4","channel":"2","volume":"0.5","id":136},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_bg_66_g9_institutecorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#4$1","duration":"0.5","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"这边！","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我记得应急通讯设备都放在顶楼的观景台里，钥匙在所长办公室——","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"跟我来！","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"0.5","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（小声）不是我们的脚步声。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（小声）这里还有其他人？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":154},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"156","text":"听起来人数不多。"}},"values":[],"id":155},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":156},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"158","text":"没时间了。"},"2":{"id":"158","text":"要尽快通知阿米娅。"}},"values":[],"id":157},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":158,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"charslot","id":161},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cndlbrn","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"抱歉，这里没有应急灯，看不清。我已经点上蜡烛了，先将就一下。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"没错......通讯设备在这里。我没用过这种东西，不确定它能传递信号的距离有多远。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这是乌萨斯军用通讯器。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":172},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"174","text":"你认识这种装置？"}},"values":[],"id":173},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":174,"end":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"Raidian有类似的装置——她年轻的时候曾参与过乌萨斯军方类似设备的研究，没想到他们竟然已经做出成果了。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"如果和我知道的一样，那这就是一种高性能全域信息广播装置。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"它搭载了一个功率极高的施术单元——功率大概相当于同时使用一百台普通军用级通讯器。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"它的设计初衷，就是为了能大范围向军用设施发送急电。当然，擅长使用感知类源石技艺的人，比如Raidian，也能接收到。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":181},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"183","text":"这难道不是好事？"},"2":{"id":"183","text":"你为什么这么紧张？"}},"values":[],"id":182},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":183,"end":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#3$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"但是它没有办法发送出特定频段的信号。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"也就是说，如果我们在这里使用这个装置发送了信息，不远处的乌萨斯军队也一定会接收到......我们的位置会立刻暴露。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士......","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":190},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"192","text":"......发送信息。"},"2":{"id":"192","text":"发送信息，然后立刻转移。"}},"values":[],"id":191},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":192,"end":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"好，听你的，博士。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"把你要发出的信息告诉我，我来操作。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":197},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"199","text":"乌萨斯，矿脉正在全面枯竭。"}},"values":[],"id":198},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":199,"end":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"已录入，还有呢？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":204},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"1","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士！小心！","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$corrosion_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act13d5d0/m_bat_corrosion_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":210,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"呃——！","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#4$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"怎么回事？他们为什么要袭击研究所？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"218","text":"至少有一支军队介入了远北事务。"}},"values":[],"id":217},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":218},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"220","text":"他们会封锁消息——"}},"values":[],"id":219},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":220,"end":226},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":221},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","volume":"1","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","channel":"2","delay":"0.3","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"好了，录入完毕！","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_button","volume":"1","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"发送——","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"234","text":"立刻撤离！"}},"values":[],"id":233},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":234,"end":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#6$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，科谢尼娅，抓紧我。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我们这就——","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":238,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":240},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"1","channel":"3","id":241},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion_stone","volume":"1","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":247},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"5","id":252},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_truckengine","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":253},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":255},{"type":"bg","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂......喂——！","id":258},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"bg","from":"1","to":"0.3","duration":"1.5","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.9","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"bg","from":"0.3","to":"1","duration":"1","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"该死......真不知道算赶上了还是没赶上。","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那个怪物，你抓我的时候不是还挺厉害的吗，你可别轻易死在这啊！","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"听到我的声音了吗？能听见吗——","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......博士？","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":277},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":278},{"type":"image","id":279},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":280}],"characters":["叶莉莎女大公","严肃的乌萨斯军官","Mon3tr","科谢尼娅","？？？"]}